@module clipboard  src=clipboard.lua  loc=574  mode=chunk  self=clipboard
@deps ec, grid, tm, cm, currentRpb, getCtx, edit, aliases, fx

# Invariants & contracts
  @invariant  clipboard persists via REAPER ExtState under ('rdm','clipboard'), serialised by util.serialise  @ 4
  @invariant  clip rows are 0-relative to the clip's top (row=0 is first row of selection); paste re-bases against current cursor row  @ 5
  @invariant  single vs multi mode is decided by selected-col count: c1==c2 -> single, otherwise multi  @ 6
  @invariant  single.parts = the parts the span covered, in column order  @ 7
  @invariant  a single clip carries notes iff parts[1] == 'pitch'  @ 8
  @invariant  a lane the span excluded is dropped at copy, filled at paste from the destination  @ 9
  @invariant  a field whose part the column doesn't show can't be excluded — it rides with the note  @ 10
  @invariant  multi.cols carry chanDelta from leftmost source channel; cursor's channel becomes the leftmost destination  @ 11
  @invariant  CLIP_RESERVED keys are stripped at copy; CLIP_ARTIFACTS (row/endRow) are stripped at paste; everything else (including custom metadata) round-trips  @ 12
  @invariant  laneEvent synthesises, never clones — no note payload may ride onto a cc destination  @ 13

# Imports
